          "code": "PARSEUSERINPUTFORREPORT",
          "convergenceTargetId": "1771088655563",
          "id": "1767685713708",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1767685713710_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Your job is to parse user input.\n\nUserInput : {{$context.$system.$inputMessage}}\n\n--From user input, if user has given date (as-of YYYY-MM-DD), then extract the date and return as EffectiveDate. Else return EffectiveDate as null.\n--From user input, if user has given listofchecks, then extract the listofchecks and return as ListOfChecks. Else return ListOfChecks as null.\n--Valid ListOfChecks values:\n   - \"UnUsedNow\"  -> Jobs not currently used in both Positions and Assignments (as of EffectiveDate or today if not provided).\n   - \"NeverUsed\"  -> Jobs that have never been used in any Position or Assignment since creation.\n   - \"IsNameTranslated\" -> Jobs missing translation in a specified language/locale.\n\n**Example Responses**\nUserInput : Fetch jobs that are never used  \nReturn  -> ListOfChecks : [\"NeverUsed\"]  \n          -> EffectiveDate : null\n\nUserInput : Fetch jobs that are not used now  \nReturn  -> ListOfChecks  : [\"UnUsedNow\"]  \n          -> EffectiveDate : null\n\nUserInput : Fetch jobs that are never used as of 2020-01-01  \nReturn  -> ListOfChecks : [\"NeverUsed\"]  \n          -> EffectiveDate : 2020-01-01\n\nUserInput : Find unused jobs over the last 6 months and flag those missing Spanish  translation.\nReturn  -> ListOfChecks : [\"UnUsedNow\", \"IsNameTranslated\"]  \n          -> EffectiveDate : null\n\nUserInput : Show jobs without translation  \nReturn  -> ListOfChecks : [\"IsNameTranslated\"]  \n          -> EffectiveDate : null"
            }
          ],
          "outputSpecification": "{\n    \"$schema\": \"http://json-schema.org/draft-04/schema#\",\n    \"type\": \"object\",\n    \"properties\": {\n        \"ListOfChecks\": {\n            \"type\": \"array\",\n            \"items\": {\n                \"type\": \"object\",\n                \"properties\": {}\n            }\n        },\n        \"EffectiveDate\": {\n            \"type\": \"string\"\n        }\n    }\n}",
