          "code": "PRESENTFAILURETOUSER",
          "id": "1770188296024",
          "inputs": [
            {
              "id": "1770188296025_1",
              "name": "prompt",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "Present the following failure details to the user in a clear and summarized format, highlighting the most important information:\n\n**FailureDetail : {{$context.$nodes.EVALUATE_FAILURE.$output.result}}.\n\nWorkflow Name: Extract WorkflowName from FailureDetail and show.\nNode Name: Extract NodeName from FailureDetail and show.\nError Message: Extract ErrorMessage from FailureDetail and show.\nPayload Valid: Extract IsValid from FailureDetail and show.\nError Available: Extract IsErrorAvailable from FailureDetail and show.\n\nEnsure that the message is easy to read, with a focus on the workflow name, node name, and error message. The status of the payload and error availability should also be presented clearly."
            }
          ],
          "type": "LLM",
          "diagram": {
